<title>USA: Costa Rica buys 26,500 T U.S./Argentine rice-trade.</title>
<headline>Costa Rica buys 26,500 T U.S./Argentine rice-trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rican millers late Friday in a private negotiation bought 26,500 tonnes Argentine or U.S. long grain rough rice at sellers' option for June 30-July 7 shipment, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The rice was bought at $296 a tonne, CIF, landed (sellers pay for discharge) and a 90-day bill of lading, one U.S. exporter said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
